  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, IEditorOnly components are purged as part of the RemoveAvatarEditorOnly callback, running at callback order -1024 (the same as EditorOnly tagged game objects). However, this means that these components are not available for callbacks running at a later phase. In particular, it's difficult to both respect EditorOnly _objects_, which should be stripped off before uploading and have no effect, while still making use of IEditorOnly components after the EditorOnly objects are removed; this requires reimplementing the EditorOnly object stripping at a callback order prior to -1024.\n\nTo fix this, ideally IEditorOnly objects would be removed at a very late callback order, perhaps +1024 or so.",
